      "message": "Yes, I don\u0027t see any issues with that.\n\nNow:\nIf I put \u0027dns.google\u0027 -\u003e DoH / default AOSP behavior?\n\nProposed:\ndns.google -\u003e DoT\nhttps://dns.google/dns-query -\u003e DoH\n\nThat does change things wrt stock Android but making it clear in the process, which sounds ok.",
      "parentUuid": "9d59daa8_32a55f85",
